WEBVTT

00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.834
You haven't stopped grinning
since you got that, Lime.

00:00:09.909 --> 00:00:11.604
I can't help it if I'm happy.

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:13.578
Your face will freeze like that.

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:16.980
Is that so? I don't think you're
in any position to tease, Bloodberry.

00:00:18.318 --> 00:00:22.448
|- always start of f my day
with a cup of hot tea.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:24.786
That's your fifteenth cup
this morning.

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:27.756
Like you can talk, Cherry!

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:04.959
| came to this land to protect you.

00:01:05.331 --> 00:01:08.528
| was born to be with you.

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:11.872
The moment I awoke...

00:01:12.505 --> 00:01:15.998
...prisms surrounded me.

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:19.510
I'm here to love you now.

00:01:19.879 --> 00:01:23.247
I was born to hold you.

00:01:23.450 --> 00:01:26.420
Lies and truths...

00:01:26.986 --> 00:01:30.650
...are all within ourselves.

00:01:31.424 --> 00:01:35.588
The days I abandon my true feelings...

00:01:35.662 --> 00:01:37.152
...won't get to me.

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:40.795
Tenderness and caring...

00:01:41.167 --> 00:01:44.228
...can be ours once again!

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:48.851
Within the eyes
of a puppet on a string.

00:01:48.875 --> 00:01:52.688
Heart shaken by a dream
that someone else contrived for me.

00:01:52.712 --> 00:01:56.092
The courage to discard
the rusted screws...

00:01:56.116 --> 00:02:00.849
...is starting to awaken inside of me.

00:02:16.469 --> 00:02:18.403
It is time to awaken her.

00:02:29.716 --> 00:02:31.309
Go, Leopard!

00:02:31.384 --> 00:02:33.910
Get me the three maiden circuits"

00:02:35.688 --> 00:02:37.156
Sir!

00:02:41.828 --> 00:02:44.263
Once we get a hold
of their maiden circuits...

00:02:44.330 --> 00:02:45.991
...we will move on to
the final project.

00:02:46.733 --> 00:02:49.634
| will hasten the remodelling
of the Sabelberg |I.

00:02:49.702 --> 00:02:52.069
Good... I will leave
for Japoness myself.

00:02:52.138 --> 00:02:53.970
Goddel, hold the fort
while I am gone.

00:02:54.040 --> 00:02:55.804
Yes, m'Lord.
You can depend on me.

00:03:07.487 --> 00:03:09.387
It's such a beautiful planet...

00:03:09.455 --> 00:03:10.388
Yes...

00:03:10.456 --> 00:03:14.324
Seeing it from up here makes the
devastation on the surface seem unreal.

00:03:14.394 --> 00:03:16.488
If only science
hadn't led man astray...

00:03:16.963 --> 00:03:18.692
I'm a scientist too, you know.

00:03:18.765 --> 00:03:20.233
0-Oops. Sorry about that!

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:28.304
Come to think of it, this here
is one of the benefits of science.

00:03:28.374 --> 00:03:31.309
I..made it for you!
It's called a "lorelei.”

00:03:32.478 --> 00:03:33.775
Faust...!

00:03:33.846 --> 00:03:35.336
It's to commemmorate our voyage.

00:03:37.116 --> 00:03:38.606
Thank you so much!

00:03:38.685 --> 00:03:41.416
I know, why don't we
plant it on the new planet?

00:03:41.487 --> 00:03:43.683
On the promised land,
somewhere out there!

00:03:44.524 --> 00:03:45.992
Yes, let's!

00:03:51.698 --> 00:03:53.325
The time has come.

00:03:53.399 --> 00:03:56.699
My love will have withstood
the test of 300 years.

00:03:58.805 --> 00:04:03.819
Soaring Emotion

00:04:03.843 --> 00:04:04.901
"O-Taru"

00:04:04.978 --> 00:04:07.447
Everybody, dig in!

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:09.148
Seconds, please!

00:04:09.716 --> 00:04:11.047
My, that was quick!

00:04:11.117 --> 00:04:14.314
It just tastes so much better
when I eat from this teacup.

00:04:14.387 --> 00:04:16.048
Seconds, please! Seconds, please!

00:04:16.122 --> 00:04:18.955
Coming, coming... Are you sure
you can handle all that food...?

00:04:19.692 --> 00:04:20.955
Here you go!

00:04:22.195 --> 00:04:23.492
Yum!

00:04:24.330 --> 00:04:27.356
Yeesh... She sure eats
a lot for a marionette...

00:04:27.433 --> 00:04:29.401
I'll have seconds, too!

00:04:29.469 --> 00:04:31.870
Hey, Otaru. A strange kid
is scamming our grub.

00:04:31.938 --> 00:04:34.964
Hey, Bloody-berry... What do
you mean by "strange kid"?

00:04:35.842 --> 00:04:37.469
But that's what you are.

00:04:37.744 --> 00:04:39.269
Th-That's so cruel!

00:04:39.345 --> 00:04:41.871
Otaru, I thought
you were my friend!!

00:04:42.749 --> 00:04:44.740
Here you go, Hannie! Eat up!

00:04:45.551 --> 00:04:49.920
Oh, Cherry.." You're a
nice marionette after all!!!

00:04:56.429 --> 00:04:58.158
Is this all I get?

00:04:59.065 --> 00:05:01.329
DO NOT COMPLAIN, JUST EAT IT!

00:05:01.401 --> 00:05:02.869
Yes, ma'am.

00:05:04.003 --> 00:05:05.698
Is Otaruin?

00:05:05.772 --> 00:05:07.968
Baiko!
Uh... Oh, yeah...

00:05:08.041 --> 00:05:10.169
...you're Hikozaemon.
I'm sorry, sir.

00:05:10.443 --> 00:05:13.572
That is all right.
| am here on urgent business.

00:05:13.846 --> 00:05:16.110
Yes, sir! What could it be?

00:05:16.182 --> 00:05:18.446
Otaru, I am sorry to
disturb you, but I request...

00:05:18.518 --> 00:05:21.419
...that you accompany me the
castle. Along with the others.

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:42.201
Thank you for coming, Otaru.

00:05:42.975 --> 00:05:46.036
Yes, sir. So, what did you
want to see me about, Shogun?

00:05:46.846 --> 00:05:49.543
First, let me introduce you. This...

00:05:50.083 --> 00:05:52.552
...is President Joy of New Texas...

00:05:52.752 --> 00:05:55.016
Wong, the head of state of Xi'an...

00:05:55.421 --> 00:05:57.389
Emperor Vilay of Romana...

00:05:58.291 --> 00:06:01.022
...and Emperor Alec of Peterburg.

00:06:02.095 --> 00:06:04.291
They are the leaders of four
of the countries of Terra ll.

00:06:04.364 --> 00:06:06.628
U-Uh.. It's an
honor to meet you!

00:06:06.699 --> 00:06:10.033
I'm... I mean,
my name is Otaru Mamiya.

00:06:10.303 --> 00:06:12.328
Otaru, why are you bowing like that?

00:06:13.139 --> 00:06:15.039
Dummy! Introduce yourselves to them!

00:06:15.475 --> 00:06:19.503
So these are the three marionettes
with the maiden circuits...

00:06:19.579 --> 00:06:21.707
They are quite lovely.

00:06:21.781 --> 00:06:23.249
You are too kind!

00:06:25.251 --> 00:06:28.482
There is but one reason we
are all gathered here today.

00:06:28.988 --> 00:06:32.424
This is about Faust's...
Gartlant's invasion, isn't it?

00:06:33.159 --> 00:06:37.528
It pains me to say this, but Peterburg
has fallen into Gartlant's clutches.

00:06:38.297 --> 00:06:43.428
They have made many attempts
to invade Japoness since then.

00:06:44.404 --> 00:06:48.068
As it stands, Japoness is holding
its own. But now, with the death...

00:06:48.141 --> 00:06:51.406
...of Shogun leyasu, there is no
telling how that situation may change.

00:06:52.011 --> 00:06:55.003
Everyone here is well aware
that I am dead.

00:06:55.081 --> 00:06:58.381
And, that only my memories
remain intact inside this body.

00:06:58.451 --> 00:07:00.886
We fear that if Faust does
succeed to take Japoness...

00:07:00.953 --> 00:07:04.617
...that next, he will come
after our countries.

00:07:04.690 --> 00:07:07.387
And, that is why
we are here today.

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:09.861
We are planning to join
our forces, and make a stand.

00:07:10.563 --> 00:07:13.294
That makes sense.
But where do WE come in?

00:07:13.866 --> 00:07:16.301
I am told that you successfully
infiltrated Gartlant...

00:07:16.369 --> 00:07:18.428
...and destroyed their main computer.

00:07:26.412 --> 00:07:28.039
Well... Yes, in the end.

00:07:28.114 --> 00:07:32.381
In other words, you know more about
Gartlant than any one of us here.

00:07:32.685 --> 00:07:36.622
We need your help, Otaru Mamiya...
..marionettes!

00:08:03.783 --> 00:08:08.084
Leopard is presently 30 kilometers
from Japoness and closing!

00:08:08.454 --> 00:08:10.183
Her estimated arrival time is 2:00!

00:08:31.043 --> 00:08:34.638
Explain this to me!
How can WE be the only survivors?!

00:08:35.348 --> 00:08:36.941
Explain, Joy!!

00:08:37.016 --> 00:08:39.144
Don't, Faust! Calm down!!

00:08:40.453 --> 00:08:42.444
Shut up!! Let go of me!

00:08:47.026 --> 00:08:48.721
What do we do now?

00:08:48.794 --> 00:08:51.354
The shuttle systems are
still working--but barely.

00:08:51.430 --> 00:08:53.228
First, let's repair the
communications equipment...

00:08:53.299 --> 00:08:55.427
...and try to gain access
to the Mesopotamia.

00:08:55.501 --> 00:08:57.299
Looks like that's all we CAN do...

00:08:57.370 --> 00:08:59.361
We can't do anything
with only six people...

00:08:59.438 --> 00:09:01.532
All right, let's get started.

00:09:01.607 --> 00:09:03.234
Lorelei...

00:09:03.309 --> 00:09:06.108
LORELEI"!

00:09:11.717 --> 00:09:13.310
ASSASSINATE FAUST??!

00:09:13.386 --> 00:09:15.377
We will issue him a final warning...

00:09:15.454 --> 00:09:18.321
...but I strongly doubt he
will heed it and withdraw.

00:09:18.391 --> 00:09:20.450
We will leave the method up to you.

00:09:20.526 --> 00:09:23.188
That will be your decision, Otaru.

00:09:24.030 --> 00:09:25.191
What?

00:09:25.431 --> 00:09:27.365
H...Hold on a moment here!

00:09:27.466 --> 00:09:30.197
Are you ordering him
to go and kill Faust?!

00:09:30.670 --> 00:09:33.696
Needless to say, I would like
you to assist him in doing so.

00:09:33.973 --> 00:09:35.941
Up yours!

00:09:36.008 --> 00:09:39.273
I agree! You can't just order
Master Otaru to commit murder!

00:09:39.345 --> 00:09:42.713
Murder? Otaru has
to commit murder?!

00:09:43.316 --> 00:09:45.444
No, he can't! He can't!

00:09:47.587 --> 00:09:49.214
This is absolutely absurd!

00:09:49.288 --> 00:09:54.590
Wasn't this conference assembled for
the purpose of AVOIDING bloodshed?!!

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:56.059
We have run out of options.

00:09:56.128 --> 00:09:58.324
There is no other way.

00:09:58.397 --> 00:09:59.728
Please try to understand!

00:10:03.102 --> 00:10:04.627
Avoid bloodshed, hm?

00:10:04.704 --> 00:10:08.698
Otaru, you are the
hero of Japoness.

00:10:08.774 --> 00:10:11.402
| wish you would act like one.

00:10:12.044 --> 00:10:15.070
There is no such thing as a hero
without blood on his hands.

00:10:17.049 --> 00:10:19.780
And, besides... if you
succeed in this mission...

00:10:19.852 --> 00:10:22.412
...you will become an even
greater hero than before.

00:10:22.788 --> 00:10:25.223
This time, you'll be
"The Savior of Terrall."

00:10:26.125 --> 00:10:28.389
We will award you with
the highest honors possible...

00:10:28.461 --> 00:10:30.555
...befitting such a title.

00:10:33.099 --> 00:10:35.033
It will be all right. You can do it.

00:10:37.003 --> 00:10:39.267
You'll do it, won't you, Otaru?

00:10:47.413 --> 00:10:49.074
Let's get out of here.

00:10:49.415 --> 00:10:51.383
"Get out"?
What do you mean, "get out"?

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:53.316
We're not through discussing this yet.

00:10:54.720 --> 00:10:56.688
You know, in elementary school...

00:10:57.523 --> 00:11:03.326
...I didn't study that hard,
but I remember one story clearly.

00:11:03.663 --> 00:11:07.531
The story of the six men who
were ejected from the Mesopotamia...

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:10.626
...and survived by working together,
and really helping each other out...

00:11:10.703 --> 00:11:14.333
...supporting each other, so they
could create their own countries...

00:11:14.407 --> 00:11:17.342
...making Terra ll
the rich planet it is today.

00:11:18.110 --> 00:11:20.340
I don't know WHAT generation
you are from the originals...

00:11:20.413 --> 00:11:22.973
...but you're the descendents
of the first six, aren't you?

00:11:23.049 --> 00:11:26.610
Whatever happened to the spirit
of helping one another?!

00:11:27.119 --> 00:11:30.987
That pact of friendship
was broken by Faust himself!

00:11:31.057 --> 00:11:34.891
Have you forgotten?! He had
Shogun leyasu murdered in cold blood!

00:11:36.095 --> 00:11:38.325
Does that make it okay
to kill in return?!

00:11:38.397 --> 00:11:41.856
Does that make it okay to just
gang up on him and kill him back?!

00:11:42.101 --> 00:11:44.331
Otaru is right on the money!

00:11:44.403 --> 00:11:48.340
You are trying to
erase sin with sin.

00:11:48.407 --> 00:11:51.502
That will not solve anything!

00:11:51.577 --> 00:11:53.705
Hold your tongue, marionette!

00:11:53.779 --> 00:11:56.214
You have no idea what this is about,
you metal-for-brains!

00:11:56.282 --> 00:11:59.252
So, we've shown our
true colors, have we?

00:11:59.318 --> 00:12:01.582
But if I may point out,
what you are trying to do...

00:12:01.654 --> 00:12:05.100
...will put you much lower than the
marionettes you are in contempt of.

00:12:05.124 --> 00:12:06.592
You impertinent...

00:12:07.426 --> 00:12:08.894
Let's go, guys.

00:12:48.701 --> 00:12:50.999
W..What is this monster?!

00:12:51.070 --> 00:12:52.697
You were sent by Faust...

00:12:55.508 --> 00:12:57.442
- Halt, scoundrel!
- Prepare to die!

00:13:18.364 --> 00:13:19.832
Go while you can, quickly!

00:13:41.453 --> 00:13:42.921
Shogun!!

00:13:44.089 --> 00:13:45.557
You fiend!

00:13:57.703 --> 00:13:59.364
Hey... What's that?

00:14:00.105 --> 00:14:02.199
Fire! The castle is on fire!!

00:14:36.508 --> 00:14:38.636
You are Otaru Mamiya?

00:14:39.011 --> 00:14:41.036
I get it... It's after me!

00:14:45.451 --> 00:14:47.681
You won't lay a finger on Otaru!

00:14:47.753 --> 00:14:49.243
You guys!

00:14:59.131 --> 00:15:00.599
Lime!

00:15:03.903 --> 00:15:05.632
You...!

00:15:05.704 --> 00:15:07.194
You mustn't fight it!

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:16.148
Lime!!!

00:15:24.089 --> 00:15:25.557
Bloodberry!!

00:15:31.063 --> 00:15:34.033
This new weapon, "Saber Beast Leopard”
is an excellent piece of hardware.

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:37.125
Her power and speed are unparalleled!

00:15:37.703 --> 00:15:39.899
Hearts are unnecessary in combat.

00:15:42.341 --> 00:15:44.139
Otaru Mamiya...

00:15:44.376 --> 00:15:46.105
Your maiden circuits are mine!

00:15:49.581 --> 00:15:51.310
Maiden circuits...?

00:15:51.383 --> 00:15:54.148
If we have those,
can you be saved, Lorelei?

00:15:54.453 --> 00:15:56.148
Yes.

00:15:56.422 --> 00:16:00.154
| understand. I will make them,
and come for you.

00:16:00.826 --> 00:16:04.262
| can go through any hardship,
as long as I know you're alive!

00:16:05.331 --> 00:16:07.322
| WILL come for you.

00:16:07.399 --> 00:16:09.094
Thank you...

00:16:09.168 --> 00:16:12.433
Don't lose hope, Lorelei!
You mustn't give up!

00:16:13.105 --> 00:16:14.436
Faust...

00:16:15.007 --> 00:16:17.339
| will come for you, I promise you!

00:16:17.409 --> 00:16:20.504
If I can't achieve it in my lifetime,
then I'll leave it to my second.

00:16:21.947 --> 00:16:23.972
If he can't, then my third!

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:25.940
My fourth...!

00:16:26.018 --> 00:16:30.046
I swear to you, Lorelei!
| will come for you!

00:16:30.122 --> 00:16:31.351
| swear?!!

00:16:31.423 --> 00:16:34.882
| understand, Faust.
I'll wait for you!

00:16:34.960 --> 00:16:38.897
Even if it takes 100 years...
Even if it takes 1,000 years...

00:16:39.999 --> 00:16:41.467
| will wait for you!

00:16:42.067 --> 00:16:43.535
Lorelei...!

00:16:55.514 --> 00:16:57.039
Damn that Faust...

00:16:57.116 --> 00:16:58.948
What the hell kind of
monster did he cook up?!

00:17:07.693 --> 00:17:10.355
This doesn't even begin to
compare with the saber dolls!

00:17:11.330 --> 00:17:12.991
But I won't let it beat me!

00:17:13.065 --> 00:17:15.033
I can't let it beat me!!

00:17:32.818 --> 00:17:33.614
Lime?!

00:17:33.685 --> 00:17:35.016
Lime!!

00:17:35.087 --> 00:17:36.555
Lime!

00:17:38.123 --> 00:17:40.057
You, you, you!!

00:17:56.475 --> 00:17:58.409
LIME

00:18:22.835 --> 00:18:24.803
Hey! Let go

00:18:32.377 --> 00:18:34.311
Lime! Cherry! Bloodberry"

00:18:35.114 --> 00:18:37.048
Hey! Let go of me, Hanagata!

00:18:37.116 --> 00:18:39.744
Don't do it, Otaru!!
You'll be killed!

00:18:40.018 --> 00:18:41.747
Otaru, run!

00:18:42.087 --> 00:18:44.249
You have to get away,
Master Otaru!

00:18:44.523 --> 00:18:46.252
GET AWAY FROM HERE, OTARUM

00:18:47.126 --> 00:18:49.094
| can't leave without you guys!!

00:18:59.171 --> 00:19:00.639
OTARUM

00:19:06.845 --> 00:19:07.903
OTARU!

00:19:07.980 --> 00:19:08.879
OTARU!

00:19:08.947 --> 00:19:10.415
MASTER OTARU"

00:19:10.983 --> 00:19:12.451
Otaru...!

00:19:15.654 --> 00:19:17.122
...not licked yet...!

00:19:19.458 --> 00:19:21.654
STOP!! PLEASE, STOP!!

00:19:23.862 --> 00:19:25.660
STOP IT™

00:19:25.731 --> 00:19:27.256
DON'T, PLEASE!

00:19:27.332 --> 00:19:28.800
OTARUM

00:20:49.581 --> 00:20:51.049
What happened?!

00:20:58.190 --> 00:20:59.954
What?! What just happened?!

00:21:00.792 --> 00:21:02.760
It's an electromagnetic wave!
I've never seen anything like it!

00:21:12.404 --> 00:21:13.530
Lime!

00:21:14.106 --> 00:21:17.667
Snap out of it!
Cherry! Bloodberry!

00:21:19.711 --> 00:21:21.679
The Mesopotamia...

00:21:23.081 --> 00:21:23.775
What?

00:22:02.020 --> 00:22:05.752
When you're sad, when you're blue...

00:22:05.824 --> 00:22:09.488
...don't go off to be alone.

00:22:09.628 --> 00:22:12.529
Just think of me...

00:22:12.597 --> 00:22:17.159
...and I'll be there with you.

00:22:17.436 --> 00:22:21.168
Strength is a very important thing...

00:22:21.239 --> 00:22:24.903
...but tears are important, too.

00:22:25.077 --> 00:22:28.856
You can't do anything at all...

00:22:28.880 --> 00:22:30.625
...with a dried-up heart.

00:22:30.649 --> 00:22:34.643
You can't feel a thing.

00:22:36.755 --> 00:22:39.087
Tell me, why do people hide...

00:22:39.157 --> 00:22:44.118
...what they really feel inside?

00:22:44.296 --> 00:22:47.960
Take what you can do,
what you want to do...

00:22:48.166 --> 00:22:51.761
...one step at a time.

00:22:52.003 --> 00:22:55.598
I love the way you don't care...

00:22:55.674 --> 00:22:59.474
...how you have been
programmed to live.

00:22:59.644 --> 00:23:03.205
| would follow you anywhere.

00:23:03.548 --> 00:23:10.011
I'll never, ever let you go.

00:23:18.463 --> 00:23:19.692
Outer space...?

00:23:19.765 --> 00:23:21.961
The attack is coming
from outer space?!

00:23:22.033 --> 00:23:23.330
Lorelei...?!

00:23:23.402 --> 00:23:25.370
Lorelei is ALIVE?!

00:23:25.437 --> 00:23:27.064
S-Stop it, Faust!

00:23:27.139 --> 00:23:29.369
I haven't got time
to mess with you!

